","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQ__7CAWwAA1Jcc?format=png&name=large"},{"type":"photo","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HRCiJ-QXkAA0Vd1?format=jpg&name=large"},{"type":"photo","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HOUdyO2X0AAVv75?format=jpg&name=large"},{"type":"photo","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HRCjdiwX0AA1QIK?format=jpg&name=large"},{"type":"photo","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/FvbQp4LWAAA_wXR?format=jpg&name=large"},{"type":"photo","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HRC7hjsWwAENImw?format=png&name=large"},{"type":"photo","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HRC8A_IWQAEIp9b?format=png&name=large"}],"stats":{},"category":"","isThread":true},{"tweetId":"2088292776047751193","sourceUrl":"https://x.com/Muninn/status/2088292776047751193","capturedAt":"2026-10-10T09:20:54.055984+00:00","createdAt":"Aug 15","fullText":"This is the article I wish I had when I started trading. And probably in year two and three as well..","author":{"handle":"@Muninn","name":"(@Muninn)"},"media":[{"type":"photo","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HPqXrczXMAAmAyE?format=jpg&name=large"}],"stats":{},"category":"","isThread":true},{"tweetId":"2084274299444072897","sourceUrl":"https://x.com/Muninn/status/2084274299444072897","capturedAt":"2026-10-10T09:20:54.055984+00:00","createdAt":"Aug 3","fullText":"Sell into strength or let it run?\n\nWhatever you decide comes with a side effect\n\nThis is the first data I have seen that says how big that side effect actually is 👇","author":{"handle":"@Muninn","name":"(@Muninn)"},"media":[{"type":"photo","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HOnpUnfWcAA93Kn?format=png&name=large"}],"stats":{},"category":"","isThread":true},{"tweetId":"2082108927471214717","sourceUrl":"https://x.com/Muninn/status/2082108927471214717","capturedAt":"2026-10-10T09:20:54.055984+00:00","createdAt":"Jul 28","fullText":"Market breadth: what actually works.\n\nI tested 45 rules against 1,500 logged breakout trades. the Stockbee Market Monitor, new highs vs new lows, $MMTW, McClellan, % above the 20-day.\n\nWhich ones help, when they help, and when to ignore all of it.","author":{"handle":"@Muninn","name":"(@Muninn)"},"media":[{"type":"photo","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HOUdyO2X0AAVv75?format=jpg&name=large"}],"stats":{},"category":"","isThread":true},{"tweetId":"1655569993881509889","sourceUrl":"https://x.com/Muninn/status/1655569993881509889","capturedAt":"2026-10-10T09:20:54.055984+00:00","createdAt":"May 8, 2023","fullText":"Sell rules matter 💸\n\n@Qullamaggie\n maxed out his IB account on a great entry in WKHS\n\nHe sold it 11 days later as it showed weakness after a presentation, with almost 150% gains 🚀\n\nIf he had followed the 10-day sell rule he would've made 350% 📈","author":{"handle":"@Muninn","name":"(@Muninn)"},"media":[{"type":"photo","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/FvbQp4LWAAA_wXR?format=jpg&name=large"}],"stats":{},"category":"","isThread":true}]},{"tweetId":"2106654769037422755","sourceUrl":"https://x.com/lucas_flatwhite/status/2106654769037422755/photo/1","capturedAt":"2026-10-10T09:20:58.079984+00:00","createdAt":"","fullText":"Click to Subscribe to lucas_flatwhite","author":{"handle":"@lucas_flatwhite","name":"lucas (@lucas_flatwhite)"},"media":[{"type":"photo","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTxXVIpbYAAKBvE?format=jpg&name=large"},{"type":"photo","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTxXVIJaAAMKEdC?format=jpg&name=large"},{"type":"photo","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTxXVIHacAAHklZ?format=jpg&name=large"},{"type":"photo","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTxXVIVaMAAQm7u?format=jpg&name=large"}],"stats":{},"category":"미수집(빈캡처)","quoted":{"tweetId":"","sourceUrl":"","capturedAt":"2026-10-10T09:20:58.079984+00:00","createdAt":"","fullText":"120개 디자인 시스템을 한곳에 모은 라이브러리.. 🎨\n\nAI 에이전트 적용하기 좋은 곳\nhttps://designsystems.one/design-systems\n\n여기서 기업/오픈소스/정부/스타트업의 실제 디자인 시스템 120개를 한 디렉터리로 묶은 페이지를 제공함.\n\n단순 링크 모음이 아니라, 항목마다 스크린샷과 스택 + 토큰 파이프라인 + 소스 모델 같은 엔지니어링 정보도 있음.\n\nCarbon, Polaris 같은 엔터프라이즈 시스템부터 shadcn/ui, Ant Design 같은 컴포넌트 라이브러리,\n\n여기에 UK, 미국 정부 USWDS 같은 공공 표준까지 범위를 넓게 잡음. 이게 특이함.\n\n항목마다 내려받을 수 있는 design.md가 있고, 내용은 렌더링된 화면이 아니라 각 시스템의 공식 문서와 토큰 패키지를 다시 적은 것임.\n\n분기마다 Agent-Ready 감사와 함께 다시 점검함.\n\n스택으로 걸러 보거나, 에이전트 대응 정도를 비교하거나, 어떤 시스템을 기반으로 만들지 추천을 받는 용도로 써보자!","author":{"handle":"","name":"인용: (URL 미확인)"},"media":[],"stats":{},"category":""},"replies":[{"tweetId":"2106662679528222875","sourceUrl":"https://x.com/sugoyona/status/2106662679528222875","capturedAt":"2026-10-10T09:20:58.079984+00:00","createdAt":"Oct 4","fullText":"토큰 파이프라인이랑 스택까지 정리되어 있으면 에이전트에 컨텍스트로 먹이기 편하겠네요.","author":{"handle":"@sugoyona","name":"Jason (@sugoyona)"},"media":[],"stats":{},"category":"","isThread":false},{"tweetId":"2106699949480329230","sourceUrl":"https://x.com/stlahxm/status/2106699949480329230","capturedAt":"2026-10-10T09:20:58.079984+00:00","createdAt":"Oct 4","fullText":"이렇게 모아두니 디자인 시스템 찾기 한결 수월하겠네요.","author":{"handle":"@stlahxm","name":"하루 (@stlahxm)"},"media":[],"stats":{},"category":"","isThread":false},{"tweetId":"2106664679959609492","sourceUrl":"https://x.com/lvn_crypto/status/2106664679959609492","capturedAt":"2026-10-10T09:20:58.079984+00:00","createdAt":"Oct 4","fullText":"정부 표준까지 들어있는 건 의외네요 에이전트 학습용 데이터로 딱일듯 ㄷㄷ","author":{"handle":"@lvn_crypto","name":"lvnbbs_bnb (@lvn_crypto)"},"media":[],"stats":{},"category":"","isThread":false},{"tweetId":"2106784725377400843","sourceUrl":"https://x.com/zhukouskikiryl/status/2106784725377400843","capturedAt":"2026-10-10T09:20:58.079984+00:00","createdAt":"Oct 5","fullText":"Hi! Thank you for mentioning :) Let me know if you have any feedback :)","author":{"handle":"@zhukouskikiryl","name":"Kiryl Zhukouski (@zhukouskikiryl)"},"media":[],"stats":{},"category":"","isThread":false},{"tweetId":"2106876516214907350","sourceUrl":"https://x.com/reviewman12817/status/2106876516214907350","capturedAt":"2026-10-10T09:20:58.079984+00:00","createdAt":"Oct 5","fullText":"오호","author":{"handle":"@reviewman12817","name":"최gpt | AI 코딩·자동화 연구자 (@reviewman12817)"},"media":[],"stats":{},"category":"","isThread":false}]},{"tweetId":"2107674791243325659","sourceUrl":"https://x.com/GithubProjects/status/2107674791243325659/photo/1","capturedAt":"2026-10-10T09:20:45.840984+00:00","createdAt":"","fullText":"Click to Subscribe to GithubProjects","author":{"handle":"@GithubProjects","name":"GitHub Projects Community (@GithubProjects)"},"media":[{"type":"photo","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HT_3DWbbkAA_nJG?format=jpg&name=large"}],"stats":{},"category":"미수집(빈캡처)","quoted":{"tweetId":"","sourceUrl":"","capturedAt":"2026-10-10T09:20:45.840984+00:00","createdAt":"","fullText":"OpenFrame CLI sets up a full Kubernetes platform locally with one command.\n\n- Creates a local cluster and installs everything\n- Also supports Google and AWS cloud clusters\n- Runs interactively or unattended for automation\n\nExplore it here:\nhttps://osp.fyi/openframe-cli","author":{"handle":"","name":"인용: (URL 미확인)"},"media":[],"stats":{},"category":""},"replies":[{"tweetId":"2107969761728680031","sourceUrl":"https://x.com/JakeRey95502906/status/2107969761728680031","capturedAt":"2026-10-10T09:20:45.840984+00:00","createdAt":"23h","fullText":"the unattended mode is the part that gets my attention","author":{"handle":"@JakeRey95502906","name":"Jake Reynolds (@JakeRey95502906)"},"media":[],"stats":{},"category":"","isThread":false}]},{"tweetId":"2107730801022652557","sourceUrl":"https://x.com/tmmrwseoul/status/2107730801022652557/photo/1","capturedAt":"2026-10-10T09:21:03.567984+00:00","createdAt":"","fullText":"저 종목 같은 경우에는 HTF 추세가 피어난지 오래되었습니다. 일봉으로 관찰시 추세랄게 없습니다. 현재 위치한 롱 베이스에서 돌파도 아직 나오지 않습니다. (별개로 지엽돌파는 8/6일 나왔습니다) 일변동폭은 3%도 되지 않는 주제에 가격은 여전히 choppy합니다. 상대강도를 길게 계산하면 여전히 시장보다 강하지만, 시계열을 달리 계산해서 재보면 큰 메리트도 없습니다.\n\n차트만 보더라도 애초 저 종목은 진입할 수 없는 종목입니다. \n가격만 볼 것이라면 가격을 제대로 봐야합니다!","author":{"handle":"@tmmrwseoul","name":"Ian Lee (@tmmrwseoul)"},"media":[{"type":"photo","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUAp_Z9acAAnvq8?forma