"@Tailscale","name":"Tailscale (@Tailscale)"},"media":[],"stats":{},"category":"AI툴","quoted":null,"replies":[{"tweetId":"2108034680184303638","sourceUrl":"https://x.com/unix2mars/status/2108034680184303638","capturedAt":"2026-10-10T09:21:05.789984+00:00","createdAt":"8m","fullText":"What if we want to do a one and done WireGuard manual connection?\n\nUnfortunately, tailscale for OpenBSD is a go userland talking via tap(4) and with all the hops to and from userland and crypto in go it ends up adding 150ms latency.\n\nFun to do egre(4) over wg(4) over urndis(4) to","author":{"handle":"@unix2mars","name":"Todd T. Fries: 𝕏🐡✝️👌🌏🇺🇸 (@unix2mars)"},"media":[{"type":"photo","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUE-Te_WcAAs-2o?format=jpg&name=large"}],"stats":{},"category":"","isThread":false},{"tweetId":"2107865943892451494","sourceUrl":"https://x.com/heysrihari/status/2107865943892451494","capturedAt":"2026-10-10T09:21:05.789984+00:00","createdAt":"11h","fullText":"localhost has left the building","author":{"handle":"@heysrihari","name":"Srihari (@heysrihari)"},"media":[],"stats":{},"category":"","isThread":false},{"tweetId":"2107910110085591393","sourceUrl":"https://x.com/iambchoor/status/2107910110085591393","capturedAt":"2026-10-10T09:21:05.789984+00:00","createdAt":"8h","fullText":"Not working for me","author":{"handle":"@iambchoor","name":"bikram (@iambchoor)"},"media":[{"type":"photo","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUDNEzIaAAAnvec?format=jpg&name=large"}],"stats":{},"category":"","isThread":false},{"tweetId":"2107739623409766734","sourceUrl":"https://x.com/TWOSOMEsays/status/2107739623409766734/photo/1","capturedAt":"2026-10-10T09:21:05.789984+00:00","createdAt":"","fullText":"저 우울해요ㅠ\nㄴ 우울하지 말자💪\n\n가우울 신메뉴 먹고\n우웅~해지세요😉\n\n부드러운 요거트에 딸기과육으로\n상큼달콤한 딸기 요거트 프라페🍓\n\n커피, 초콜릿, 치즈폼의 만남\n조화로움에 마음까지 두근대는 블랙 치즈폼 라떼☕\n\nRT + 팔로우 = 블랙 치즈폼 라떼 (3명)\n당첨자 발표 : 10/13 (화)","author":{"handle":"@TWOSOMEsays","name":"투썸플레이스 (@TWOSOMEsays)"},"media":[{"type":"photo","url":"https://pbs.tw