 to ohiain","author":{"handle":"@ohiain","name":"iain (@ohiain)"},"media":[],"stats":{},"category":"미수집(빈캡처)","quoted":{"tweetId":"","sourceUrl":"","capturedAt":"2026-10-10T09:20:52.665984+00:00","createdAt":"","fullText":"I genuinely think you could build an entire trading system around 1 moving average + 1 lower-timeframe confirmation.\n\n$MU\n + $SNDK\n today were textbook examples...\n\nStep 1: Pull up a chart, slap on the 9week EMA, and wait for leadership to come to you.\n\nStep 2: Once it hits that area, I’m waiting for the right-side curl on the 15/30min → green candle forms → high becomes my trigger → high breaks, I enter → stop goes to LOD.\n\nYou practically would've bottom-ticked both $MU\n & $SNDK\n without ever trying to call the bottom.  The process goes... leadership + major support + lower-TF confirmation + stupidly tight risk.\n\nFocus on removing the noise and repeat these asymmetric opportunities until you’re bored of printing insanely easy cash.\n\nIt works for me, so let me know how it works for you;)","author":{"handle":"","name":"인용: (URL 미확인)"},"media":[],"stats":{},"category":""},"replies":[{"tweetId":"2107883669998219399","sourceUrl":"https://x.com/RiskFirstHQ/status/2107883669998219399","capturedAt":"2026-10-10T09:20:52.665984+00:00","createdAt":"10h","fullText":"Weekly > Daily > 30 min; 9ema, 21ema, 50e/sma, 200e/sma; Volume and price. All that is needed tbh to get a full picture, could simplify even more. But above all is risk management. \n\nSitting on my hands in $SNDK\n and $MU\n expecting today to be the bottom of the latest pullback.","author":{"handle":"@RiskFirstHQ","name":"RiskFirst (@RiskFirstHQ)"},"media":[],"stats":{},"category":"","isThread":false},{"tweetId":"2107896528316866822","sourceUrl":"https://x.com/ohiain/status/2107896528316866822","capturedAt":"2026-10-10T09:20:52.665984+00:00","createdAt":"9h","fullText":"Summed up my system in 1 reply, well done.","author":{"handle":"@ohiain","name":"iain (@ohiain)"},"media":[],